Package: l2trader
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         libqt6sql6-sqlite
Description: Real-time algorithmic trading application
 L2Trader is a sophisticated trading platform built with Qt6 that connects
 to TradeStation APIs to provide real-time market data analysis, Level 2
 market depth visualization, and position tracking.
 .
 Key Features:
  * Real-Time Market Data with Level 2 quotes
  * Interactive Price Charts
  * Position Tracking
  * Algorithmic Trading capabilities
  * Market data replay from recorded sessions

Package: l2trader-strategy-sdk
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Runtime library for external L2Trader strategy executables
 Provides the shared client runtime used by external L2Trader strategies.
 It includes the length-prefixed Protobuf transport helpers and public
 protocol/runtime support needed by out-of-process strategy processes.

Package: l2trader-strategy-sdk-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: l2trader-strategy-sdk (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}, libprotobuf-dev
Description: Development files for building external L2Trader strategies
 Provides the installable C++ SDK headers, generated Protobuf headers,
 raw .proto schema files, and CMake package metadata for building external
 strategy executables against the L2Trader strategy SDK.
